CURRENT PROBLEM
========================================================

Right now, Chat UI elements remain visible even after leaving the Chat screen.

Examples:

• Menu button
• AI selector
• Composer
• Chat input
• Floating controls

These elements should NEVER exist outside the Chat screen.

They currently behave like global overlays.

This is incorrect.

========================================================
GOAL
========================================================

Chat components must belong ONLY to the Chat screen.

When leaving Chat:

Everything related to Chat disappears.

The next screen owns its own layout.

No Chat controls should ever appear on:

• Search
• Settings
• Projects
• Documents
• Images
• Future screens

Every screen owns its own header.

Every screen owns its own controls.

